    {
      "source_id": "wikipedia:en:1002",
      "source_type": "wikipedia",
      "title": "List of characters in the Breaking Bad franchise",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_characters_in_the_Breaking_Bad_franchise",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-10-03T12:00:00Z",
      "text": "This is a list of characters in the Breaking Bad franchise.\n\n## Main characters\n\n### Walter White\nWalter White is a chemistry teacher who becomes a methamphetamine manufacturer.\n\n### Jesse Pinkman\nJesse Pinkman is Walter's former student and business partner.\n\n### Hank Schrader\nHank Schrader is a DEA agent married to Marie Schrader, the sister of Skyler White.",
